 # Presentation Timing Guidelines
+
+## An Nhiên adaptation
+
+Use the 15-minute guidance as a planning aid, not a promise. The local storyboard contains about 13 minutes of speech, leaving room for transitions within a 15-minute slot. Clarify whether Q&A shares the slot before final rehearsal. Keep 16 main slides unless the user changes that assumption. Scientific-talk examples below are illustrative; preserve the UX case-study arc in `storyboard.md`.
